       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QLINT13.
      * REVOLVING INTEREST - BASE EXCLUDES DUES
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-BALANCE                PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-UNPAID-CHARGES         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-UNPAID-LEVIES          PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-UNPAID-TAXES           PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-BASE                   PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-APR                    PIC 9(2)V99 VALUE 40.00.
       01  WS-INTEREST               PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-BALANCE
           ACCEPT WS-UNPAID-CHARGES
           ACCEPT WS-UNPAID-LEVIES
           ACCEPT WS-UNPAID-TAXES
           PERFORM 2000-INTEREST
           DISPLAY 'INTEREST: ' WS-INTEREST
           STOP RUN.
       2000-INTEREST.
           COMPUTE WS-BASE = WS-BALANCE - WS-UNPAID-CHARGES
                   - WS-UNPAID-LEVIES - WS-UNPAID-TAXES
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-INTEREST
           IF WS-BASE > ZERO
              COMPUTE WS-INTEREST ROUNDED = (WS-BASE * WS-APR) / 1200
           END-IF.
